New Year-ku girlfriend kooda four hours drive panni cabin-ku poreenga. Door open panna… already innoru couple inside! Avangalum unga maadhiriye booking confirmation kaamikiraanga. Idhu cabin-aa, waiting room-aa?

**LOCK-IN (6–14 sec)**

Idhu epdi possible? Imagine pannunga: neenga Reserve click panreenga. Adhe second-la innoru person-um same dates-ku click panraanga.

**FIRST REVEAL (14–26 sec)**

Bad design enna pannum? First availability check pannum. Available-na booking save pannum. Aana rendu requests same time-la check pannina, rendu perukkum available-nu result varalaam! Idhu dhaan **race condition**.

**THE FIX (26–38 sec)**

Solution: **Atomic transaction.** Booking dates-ah oru group-ah claim pannanum. Ella nights-um available-na mattum complete booking. Oru night kooda unavailable-na full transaction rollback. One wins; another gets booking unavailable!

**SECOND WOW (38–48 sec)**

Next, Pay button freeze aagudhu. Neenga twice click panniteenga. Double payment aaguma? Idhukkuthaan **idempotency key**. Same payment request retry aana, same key use panni duplicate charge-ah prevent pannalaam. Airbnb-oda Orpheus library indha concept-ku real engineering example.

**THE TWIST (48–56 sec)**

Aana owner Airbnb-la mattum illa, Vrbo-layum list pannirundha? Airbnb-oda connected calendars automatic-ah every three hours refresh aagum. So external booking update late aagura chance irukku!

**CLOSING + CTA (56–65 sec)**

